      "excerpt": "8.4.2 Related Response Headers ............................................... 87\n8.4.2 Related Response Headers\n\nThe following header is used by the ASPSP to transmit decisions of the chosen SCA Approach\nto the third party.\n\nPublished by the Berlin Group under Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 International Public License Page 87\n  (ref. License Notice for full license conditions)\nSecurity Measures supported by XS2A and openFinance API\n\nAttribute Type\n\nASPSP-SCA- String\nApproach",
      "provenance": [
        {
          "source_id": "bg-openfinance-v2-protocol-functions",
          "document_id": "bg-openfinance-v2-protocol-functions@323d2484a9cb",
          "version": "openfinance-v2",
          "kind": "pdf",
          "authority": "normative",
          "precedence": 100,
          "locator": "chunk:bg-openfinance-v2-protocol-functions:p5:c9",
          "sha256": "699cb4302edcb500cf626de3001825c6bf729bd893edf4241dd86599a2b5e476",
          "document_sha256": "323d2484a9cb08a8e657699180557244843f74605bdeec16349654114d5aa851"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "bg-openfinance-v2-protocol-functions",
          "document_id": "bg-openfinance-v2-protocol-functions@323d2484a9cb",
          "version": "openfinance-v2",
          "kind": "pdf",
          "authority": "normative",
          "precedence": 100,
          "locator": "chunk:bg-openfinance-v2-protocol-functions:p94:c1",
          "sha256": "be2edc2d5a56c57b8f5e00ec8490c337b58b2a5c56f4244352b89ba6653d94eb",
          "document_sha256": "323d2484a9cb08a8e657699180557244843f74605bdeec16349654114d5aa851"
        },
        {
